{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T18:39:44.282560Z","level":"info","event":"    \"applicant_eligibility_description\": \"As one of the main goals of this NOFO is to move technologies quickly to market, participation of the following entities is limited as follows: \\n\\nInstitutions of higher education are eligible to participate as a recipient or subrecipient for Topic Area 1 but are only eligible to participate as a subrecipient for Topic Area 2.   \\n\\nProvided there is no conflict of interest, DOE FFRDCs3 are eligible to apply for funding as subrecipients but are not eligible to apply as recipients. \\n\\nNon-DOE FFRDCs are eligible to participate as subrecipients but are not eligible to apply as recipients.   \\n\\nFederal agencies and instrumentalities (other than DOE) are eligible to participate as subrecipients but are not eligible to apply as recipients. \\n\\nThe National Energy Technology Laboratory (NETL) is eligible to apply as a subrecipient, not as prime recipient.\",","logger":"task.stdout"}
